  "description": "Multi-stage pyrotechnic shells that bloom in two acts. A primary burst erupts first, then delayed secondary crackle and palm fronds spawn from sub-points along the fading sparks. Treble drives thousands of micro-crackle pops; mids trigger the second-stage palm arms. Bass deepens the initial detonation. Mouse launches a triple-stage command shell at the cursor.",
